{
  "slug": "zoominfo",
  "name": "Zoominfo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Search companies and contacts, enrich leads, find lookalikes, and get AI-ranked contact recommendations. Pre-built skills chain multiple ZoomInfo tools into complete B2B sales workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **35 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (35): `account-health` (Assess the health of an account from its recent conversations — sentiment trajectory and risk signals — backed…), `account-relationship-recap` (Recap where things stand with a company across recent conversations, with emphasis on how the relationship is evolving), `account-research` (Produce a full intelligence brief on a target company — firmographics, CRM/account context, intent signals, recent news, scoops,…), `ae-cs-handoff` (Produce an AE-to-CS handoff brief — everything the incoming CSM needs from the sales conversations), `build-list` (Build a list of contacts or companies matching specific criteria), `buying-committee` (Map the buying committee at a target account), `call-coaching` (Coach a rep on how they handled a specific call — discovery quality, objection handling, talk dynamics, and…), `call-recap` (Recap a recent call with a tight summary, the decisions made, action items, and open questions), and 27 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `zoominfo`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install zoominfo@claude-plugins-official` from `Zoominfo/zoominfo-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
